    "text": "Let X be a non-empty class of finite groups of odd order closed under taking\nsubgroups, homomorphic images, and extensions. Let H be an X-maximal subgroup\nof a finite group G, and N a normal subgroup of G. Must H ∩ N be an X-maximal\nsubgroup of N ?                                                W. Guo, D. O. Revin",
